# AI Provider Tycoon — Ideas

Parking lot for concepts not yet in scope.

## Talent

People as a resource: research velocity multiplier, salary line, hire/fire, poaching between players.

Possible mechanics:
- Hire / fire by role + count + salary
- Talent count as private state
- Salaries contribute to burn
- Talent poaching: offer above-market salary to take a competitor's employee
- Talent market shift events (supply/cost shocks)
- Research output = f(research compute, talent, time)

Punted because: adds an entire resource axis + inter-player action surface before the core loop is proven.
